# CLAUDE.md / GEMINI.md are symlinks to AGENTS.md, and Spec Kit's
# `safe_extract_archive` refuses an archive that contains one:
#
#   Validation Error: Unsafe symlink in tar.gz archive: <repo>-main/CLAUDE.md
#
# With them in the tarball, `specify preset add --from …` fails before anything
# is read. Keeping them out of the archive keeps both properties: an agent that
# opens CLAUDE.md in a clone finds the rules, and the distributed archive is
# symlink-free. Measured on the sibling preset spec-kit-typo3, 2026-08-17 — this
# repository was set up with the fix rather than discovering it again.
/CLAUDE.md export-ignore
/GEMINI.md export-ignore

# Not part of the preset a consumer installs. CHANGELOG.md stays in — the
# publishing guide lists it as part of the preset structure.
/.gitattributes export-ignore
